.1 万个广告主、4.3 万条独立创意和 41 万次广告出现，覆盖 970 个细分领域。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;而且它会把每则广告和当时使用的测试 Prompt 对应起来。做出海投放或 SaaS 的，可以拿它看竞品素材，研究哪些购买需求更容易出现广告。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;👉&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ahhhhfs.com/82196/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;https://www.ahhhhfs.com/82196/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/mqrxL4D3tn02rQSnaPHNTsXhc6emMCRzY2wLt1ZS-BYl48bHiYcsoJzC0u_j0sV4F94h-TIlmt0fipsZCsQH2AKeu3UxZv4FcRGA9VRBqRxZdPkk1Gwcq6Jg8Jn6bxS73TH5PyzuQ0YNtKfznNAQCcoyogR6gJU92WonTEcVSBubNw6dxbcJBZvpJ-TLJ6fMxWyEc5LmGhwgGuya0DE-Z0T4OaoT8CIhKE4qdkldlDHX-hNWqdhdl8-2tdouKLNnimQ4MfoSNNlNTz-Vk_RR-l8_k7-PegJTQuKHfFjYt2cbhabiGXaGLzUfBCHpnom63s0jjhRPipyv2tCtrbJ_aA.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/abskoop/13070</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/abskoop/13070</guid><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 12:58:51 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 Workbuddy成长计划里面的任务：体验「腾讯轻量云」专家，领取一个月轻量应用服务器</title><description>&lt;p&gt;Workbuddy成长计划里面的任务：体验「腾讯轻量云」专家，领取一个月轻量应用服务器 &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;有需要的可以试试&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/JVVHnf3sPpDbqK_d5yaR8enNMLhPF10NLnKoPZ8RqQbofRttc7C7g7HPLvNUDsvYHDkvUJ-Fqm8hDgXOfSz41u9GnL6j37VIHCsTgSiYFyxs9NEo_qJ_qoWbLJgdnxDIrFU5-hsJ_7KPSbRCHdBNIXU1JyyvhaP62TnFNRd9heHll4pZ4faAomu5BYt5OaD7R-2KUxizwlEPlkm_WVoR3Y4iY6ZA78qZCW2txPi3PMxbv9gVG7vOytOchz8xXFQOMF5wkYnT2Hk4XuyCBWjbvMmZMeUXJmUvMXsR0-zklH43HX75DUfiay3H7R04t33hiNaMxTTO6cTmgLr8tDWxkQ.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/abskoop/13069</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/abskoop/13069</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 09:24:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 受不了 Logitech Options+ 后台常驻、登录账号？🤡</title><description>&lt;p&gt;受不了 Logitech Options+ 后台常驻、登录账号？&lt;tg-emoji emoji-id=&quot;5371074117971745503&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;🤡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/tg-emoji&gt;&lt;b